{"id":"steam-577240","steam":577240,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"CogVR","summary":"A robot tests your thinking skills on a strange spaceship.  That's just weird. \r\nIs your human mind powerful enough to ace the tests?  If so, you may just save the world.\r\n\r\nExercises inspired by clinical cognitive tests.","about":"Set your mind free\n\r\n\r\nYou were kidnapped by aliens and your mind is the only weapon that you can use against them. Solve the puzzle, outsmart your oppressors and save yourself, save the world!\r\n\r\n\nChallenge your mind! \n\r\n\r\nTest your brain sharpness in six different levels. Use your dexterity, concentration, perceptivity and think out of the box to complete'em all!\r\n\r\n\nReal fun - Real tests\n\r\n\r\nAll of the tests was prepared based on cognitive and rehabilitative clinical trials in cooperation with Medical Doctors.\r\nImprove yourself!\r\nRaise your skills - compare your scores with the players from the whole world, with your friends and your family. Can you beat them and show the real power of your mind ?","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577240/portrait.png?t=1510156158","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577240/header.jpg?t=1510156158","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577240/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1510156158","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577240/header.jpg?t=1510156158","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577240/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1510156158","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577240/ss_9a34483af4b10f512d874e27948d93581be63418.600x338.jpg?t=1510156158","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577240/ss_9a34483af4b10f512d874e27948d93581be63418.jpg?t=1510156158"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.